#, no-c-format
msgid "The Invert filter"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-filters.docbook:454
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This filter inverts all colors. The Red, Green and Blue component of each "
"pixel are taken and subtracted from 255. This means that red becomes cyan, "
"green becomes purple, and blue becomes yellow. The resulting values form the "
"new pixel color."
msgstr ""

